# Conformance probe pack for ruling 19 of spec 0.7 on the `json` wire: the
# pack-wide typemap applies to the key `type` inside items. Public. No kinds.
# The native code here is `J`; the protobuf probe pack writes `T` for the same
# model value, so a conversion between the two rewrites the code in each item.
format  conformance-groups-rulings-json
version 0.7.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   uid  id  string
group   probe.items  items
  field  type         t     string
  field  probe.label  name  string
end
typemap J a-f-G
